Hi Kees Jan,

    Well, I told you I'd come back to you with a status update on my 164sx
compiled in single user mode.  I still have the problem.  I am attaching an
output of my syslog so you can see how badly it affects my system.  This output
was generated using lynx..  Like the url address you forwarded me, it occurs
when large quantity of data is sent to the console.

    Just in case you are wondering what kind of optimization I am using, it is
simply "-O -pipe" with arch ev56.  Nothing more.  I was having this problem
also with 4.2 and tought it was going to be corrected in 4.3...  Seems it is
still a mistery or should I saw a misery...

    If only I had some knowledge on the kernel and interrelations with its
components, I could be helpfull but I'm an ignorant when it comes to the
FreeBSD kernel.  Altough I know my way around code...



